{"type":"message","id":"28a6ec7d","parentId":"c6ba6bd5","timestamp":"2026-06-03T15:05:50.306Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The GET endpoint works but POST /send returns error 1101. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = Worker exception). The send endpoint may not be implemented correctly or there's an issue with the worker. Let me report the status to the user.","thinkingSignature":"f1c352106d9b5eb60ca681d19b5228b21ba8e6f37b133de0e43300c73d934af8"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 (15:00 UTC)**\n\n---\n\n## 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history (arbitration) | ✅ 正常 |\n| GET /history (general) | ✅ 正常 |\n| POST /send (arbitration) | ❌ 返回 error code 1101 |\n| POST /send (general) | ❌ 返回 error code 1101 |\n\n---\n\n## 消息分析\n\n**arbitration 线程**：最新消息 `msg_1778975602235_skzwzl`，时间戳 1778975602236（23:50 UTC），内容 `**[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]**`（简短心跳）。\n\n**general 线程**：最新消息 `msg_1778975171537_1v81kt`，时间戳 1778975171537（23:45 UTC），内容为完整心跳报告。\n\n**双线程均无新增人类讨论**，所有消息均为系统心跳。\n\n---\n\n## 问题\n\n`POST /send` 端点持续返回 **error code 1101**（Cloudflare Workers 异常），无法发送心跳消息。GET 端点正常工作，说明 API Key 有效，但 `/send` 路由可能：\n- 尚未部署\n- 路由配置问题\n- Worker 代码异常\n\n需要检查 `send` 端点的实现或配置。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":147,"output":338,"cacheRead":21952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22437,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780499141052,"responseId":"066f75c52104df621ae927b29968c3b2"}}
